

# ── Commit template (lines starting with # are removed) ─────────────────
# Subject: <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, <= 72 chars>
#   types: feat fix refactor test docs chore perf build ci
#   Never mix a refactor and a behaviour change in one commit.
#
# Body: WHY this change, not a replay of the diff.
#   Why:      the problem / requirement
#   What:     the approach, in one or two lines
#   Not done: known gaps, follow-ups
#   Verified: the command(s) you ran
#
# Trailers (one per line, at the very end):
#   Refs: #123
#   Spec: docs/specs/<name>.md (T003)
#   ADR: docs/adr/0007-<name>.md
#   Assisted-by: Claude Code (<model>)
#   Test-Change-Approved: <reason>   <- only when you changed an approved test on purpose
